@startuml istina_integration
!theme plain
title ИСТИНА System Integration Architecture / ИСТИНА系统集成架构

' Define participants
participant "ИСТИНА\n(ИАС «ИСТИНА»)" as ISTINA #LightBlue
participant "Export\nAdapter" as Adapter #LightGreen
participant "Chinese Name\nRecognizer\n(v8.0)" as Algorithm #LightCoral
participant "Decision\nLogger" as Logger #LightYellow
participant "Statistical\nAnalyzer" as Stats #LightPink
participant "Audit\nTrail" as Audit #LightGray

' Main flow
== Data Export ==
ISTINA -> Adapter: Export authors\n(JSON/JSONL)
activate Adapter
note right of Adapter
  Normalize fields:
  - original_name
  - lastname/firstname
  - person_id
end note

== Batch Processing ==
Adapter -> Algorithm: Process batch\n(N records)
activate Algorithm

loop For each record
  Algorithm -> Algorithm: Identify surname order
  note right of Algorithm
    Profile: ISTINA
    - Chinese prior: 0.5
    - Western prior: 0.3
    - Batch consistency: ON
  end note

  Algorithm -> Logger: Log decision event
  activate Logger
  note right of Logger
    DecisionEvent:
    - prediction + confidence
    - scores + margin
    - fired modules
    - reasons (top-K)
    - latency
  end note
  Logger -> Logger: Hash record_id\n(with salt)
  Logger --> Algorithm: ACK
  deactivate Logger
end

Algorithm --> Adapter: Results\n(predictions)
deactivate Algorithm

== Statistical Analysis ==
Adapter -> Stats: Generate reports
activate Stats
Stats -> Stats: Calculate metrics\n(3 scopes)
note right of Stats
  Scopes:
  1. end_to_end (primary)
  2. conditional
  3. coverage
end note
Stats -> Stats: Confidence intervals\n(Wilson score)
Stats -> Stats: McNemar tests\n(if applicable)
Stats --> Adapter: Reports\n(JSON/MD/TEX)
deactivate Stats

== Audit Trail ==
Adapter -> Audit: Store artifacts
activate Audit
Audit -> Audit: run_manifest.json
Audit -> Audit: decision_events.jsonl
Audit -> Audit: stats_ci_global.*
Audit -> Audit: module_coverage.*
Audit --> Adapter: ACK
deactivate Audit

== Redaction (for paper) ==
Adapter -> Logger: Redact logs\n(200 samples)
activate Logger
Logger -> Logger: Remove input_tokens
Logger -> Logger: Add token_hash + shape
Logger -> Logger: Sample priority:\n- unknown\n- low margin\n- exceptions
Logger --> Adapter: Redacted sample
deactivate Logger

Adapter --> ISTINA: Pilot summary report
deactivate Adapter

note over ISTINA, Audit
  **Deliverables / 交付物**:
  ✓ Decision event logs (full + redacted 200)
  ✓ Statistical reports (3 scopes)
  ✓ Module coverage analysis
  ✓ Performance benchmarks
  ✓ LaTeX tables for paper
  ✓ Redaction policy document
  ✓ run_manifest.json (reproducibility)
end note

@enduml
